UID:ddqBFWlUED
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nSemi-nomadic shepherd and cheese
 maker Gara raises her 13-year-old niece Nada as her own. As she fights to 
 protect her grazing land from a NATO military expansion\, Nada begins to i
 magine her own future. This film is generously sponsored by Mary Rainwater
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/to-hold-a-mountain\n\nEstimated start: 
 18:10
LOCATION:PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Center\, None
END:VEVENT
